# portal/Dockerfile (guidefold-portal image): static docs site, no secrets, no code.
!portal/
!portal/**
# ui/Dockerfile (guidefold-ui image): `pnpm build` (tsc --noEmit && vite build) only
# needs package.json/pnpm-lock.yaml, src/, vite.config.ts, index.html and public/ —
# tsconfig.json's own `include` is just ["src", "vite.config.ts"]. Re-excluding the
# rest keeps node_modules (reinstalled fresh in the image anyway) and QA/test
# artifacts (baseline screenshots, playwright output) out of the build context.
!ui/
!ui/**
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/
ui/.vitest/
ui/test-results/
ui/qa/
ui/e2e/
